  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ENH OF PRIORITY WTLDS IN RIO SAN FERNAND</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will protect (10,393.76) acres of Laguna La Nacha, protect 1,235 acres of Rancho Rospan through a private land conservation agreement and protect (7,410) acres of Rancho El Lindero through a private land conservation agreement. Also, (11,063.13) acres of wetlands will be enhanced in Laguna La Nacha and Rancho El Lindero. Also other activities will include such as establishing community surveillance programs for the prevention and reporting of environmental crimes, offer environmental education workshops, developing a management plan for the sustainable use of natural resources in Rancho El Lindero.</narrative>
  </description>
